  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“See, aren’t these attacks a lot more helpful when your friends don’t have to dodge them too?”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Infusion class ability</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use a kinetic blast that affects multiple spaces, you may select 1 square that is not affected by your blast. For each 2 points of burn you have, you may select an addition square to be unaffected by your blast.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc55\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
